  entry
    definition "not counterfeit or copied"
    examples ("an authentic signature" "a bona fide manuscript" "an unquestionable antique" "photographs taken in a veritable bull ring")
    id oewn-01119377-s
    partOfSpeech s
    synonyms ("bona fide" unquestionable veritable)
